# Live vs helper vs archive

CL app owns its live catalog, support helpers, and apparel images. Resolve via `shared/paths.py`:

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `Custom Label Database/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | **Live** working DB |
| `Custom Label Database/backups/` | Pre-change catalog snapshots |
| `Custom Label Database/support/` | Size refs, shirts print sizes, mocks, Workbook restore |
| `Custom Label Database/Apparel Images/` | Apparel image library |
| `data/product_export/ProductExport.csv` | Product catalog (UID join) |

Useful scripts (app `scripts/`): `fill_from_seeds.py`, `generate_from_mocks.py`, `download_apparel_images.py`, `fill_cl_database.py` (legacy template expand).

Run Python from the Custom Label Database app folder. Prefer scripts over opening the full CSV in the editor.
